  input
  path
  replaced
-- want-list-stdout.txt --
home/.config/invox/archive/list
-- want-customer-config.txt --
warning: customer config is deprecated; use customer edit
error: cannot open an editor: stdin is not a terminal; edit home/.config/invox/customers.yaml directly
Run 'invox customer config --help' for usage.
-- want-new-defaults.txt --
Would create CUST-001-002.yaml for CUST-001 (CUST-001-002)
-- want-new-source.txt --
warning: -s, --source is deprecated; use --defaults
Would create CUST-001-002.yaml for CUST-001 (CUST-001-002)
-- want-send.txt --
warning: send only drafts an email; use 'invox email'
error: missing required input: INVOICE.yaml, INVOICE.pdf, or -i, --input
Run 'invox email --help' for usage.
-- want-complete-archive.txt --
add	Archive a built or edited invoice YAML file into the configured archive directory
edit	Copy an archived invoice into the current directory and mark it as editing
list	List archived invoices from the configured archive directory
:4
-- want-complete-customer.txt --
edit	Open customers.yaml in your editor
list	List all customers from customers.yaml
:4
-- home/.config/invox/config.yaml --
archive:
  dir: archive
-- home/.config/invox/customers.yaml --
CUST-001:
